Modifications (2026, vshijiav):
- Replaced the SignalRGB HTTP API client with a QWebChannel client for
  SignalRGB's local WebPipe channel (webpipe.py, client.py).
- Rewrote the light, select and button platforms for push updates; added
  number, switch and text platforms for effect parameters and effect rotation.
- Added Windows tools: webpipe_relay.py and the srgb command-line tool.
- Replaced the test suite.
